<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK NOV DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.41 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK NOV DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.41 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Wednesday the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month was 6.41 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Nov 8			 8,400</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Nov		6,362</p>
<p> Average reserves to Nov 5			    6,138</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    6,407</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom, +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
